response:
It's a tough thing to deal with being unhappy in a relationship. Every situation is different, and I can't provide you with specific advice for leading to your divorce.

If your marriage is in trouble, I would recommend separating if it is emotionally possible, or proceed to seek professional advice. There could be better solutions for your affairs than divorce. First, consider the existence of a civil court allowing you to initiate divorce proceedings.

When it comes to divorce, the process can be lengthy, complicated, and emotionally challenging. The marriage resolution phase of your divorce can help people focus on personal areas of improvement.&#x20;
